{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "144aa00999c993bf2082dd4ab9d356888bdae3dc39db47f800fbb81872bc797a", "ja": "このみさん……\nあ、すみません。電話中でしたか？", "zh": "小此木小姐……\n啊，抱歉。您刚才在打电话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "e3e51e3228cff2043a372d69747355fd396994fcef9da34dc01def6b04946ff3", "ja": "あら、大丈夫よ{$P$}。\n今、終わったところだから。", "zh": "啊，没事的，{$P$}。我刚刚才打完电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "75349c1fae56e2a31a639b8ef4b1f9f1f388c265ed283621e2513d79e1694ce6", "ja": "妹が、CLEVER CLOVERの公演を\n観に来たんですって。わざわざ感想をくれたの。", "zh": "我妹妹说，她去看CLEVER CLOVER的\n演出了。还特意给我发来了感想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8643e4df3798ed0c6df3a92c0f33bb12eb3cd4f3736305a35127e886e5c7d407", "ja": "えっ。北東エリアまで、\nわざわざ観に来てくれたんですか？", "zh": "诶。她特意跑到东北地区来看演出吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "62c8545fd0359ccdff1d8ce96165253224b1625c6a6603053412ef79f4695619", "ja": "ええ。「最初は普段と変わらない役かと思ったけど、\n最後は全然印象が違って、びっくりした！」ですって。", "zh": "嗯。她说：“本来还以为一开始是个和你平时没什么两样的角色，没想到最后给人的感觉完全不同，吓了一跳！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "fbe3d684bf55e866857499d642c83d4ad5ddfeae534200bdac3b93bf964dd448", "ja": "私は、桃子ちゃんや琴葉ちゃんと違って、演技に\nそこまで自信があったわけじゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "我不像桃子和琴叶那样，对演技有那么大的自信……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "039fc3ad82599adf28f37010a03818ee8fa9d85e96dfffddc86514e80d5cb59a", "ja": "でも家族にそう言われると、私のお芝居も\n案外悪くないのかも？って思うわね。ウフフ♪", "zh": "不过被家人这么一说，我也会觉得，自己的演技说不定还挺不错的？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fbaf31dbc5e7ce55a524371f621f55c2486ea19b650024823ef3663d319790d9", "ja": "そこは、培ってきたものがありますし。このみさんの\n表現力は、しっかり発揮されていたと思いますよ！", "zh": "这方面，毕竟是您一直积累下来的东西。我觉得，您充分展现出了出色的表现力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "028ec86523ab91e3d4d370660df8caecd82697278e23b6167c2eca39989ca25a", "ja": "でもね……妹は、こうも言ってたの。「小さい子に\n囲まれているのに違和感がなくて、可愛かった」……。", "zh": "不过啊……妹妹还这么说过。“明明被一群小孩子围着，却一点违和感都没有，很可爱”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1011_p", "source_sha256": "896e66a29d5eeb9a78a6581149ec8b834474ef99f1bae8cc2e95ccaacfc44194", "ja": "環やひなた達とも、馴染んでましたからね……。\nさすが、このみさんです。", "zh": "和环和日向她们相处得也很融洽呢……不愧是木实小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "7c203de56e2b58279d3ac01c3a43ba003178306695162e5b422edca82c2e6bb9", "ja": "ちゃんと仕事が成立したのはいいけど、\n素直に受け止められない自分もいるのよね……。", "zh": "工作顺利谈成当然是好事，可我也有点没法坦率地接受这一点呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b0c57b80004fde8a0109a8554d1966389c182c1fed78afa4f16803457e8a2716", "ja": "そこは、考え方で！　シリアスなお芝居と\nアダルティなライブで、ギャップを感じてもらえばと。", "zh": "关键在于转换思路！通过严肃的戏剧表演和成熟风格的演出，让大家感受到其中的反差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "e3dfc161332632fd3a2d4410e1dab78af83474d95a083c49615190bd7ed62eda", "ja": "な、なるほど……！　演技とステージのギャップで、\nお客さんをメロメロにさせちゃう作戦なのね！？", "zh": "原、原来如此……！是要利用演技和舞台之间的反差，把客人迷得神魂颠倒的作战啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "5c0c203276cc39320f68971d013fff90169107af36eaef1cc170a1a44a9a9b5a", "ja": "初めて配役をみた時、私ひとりだけ年が\n離れてたから。浮いちゃわないか心配だったけど……。", "zh": "第一次看到角色分配时，只有我的年龄比较大。所以我还担心会不会显得格格不入……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "3be13fc595fe3bfcd82a4b5e5e8e5f30991141c134872632ba0fb838067114fe", "ja": "それも……ギャップのため……！", "zh": "这也是……为了反差萌……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3be13fc595fe3bfcd82a4b5e5e8e5f30991141c134872632ba0fb838067114fe", "ja": "それも……ギャップのため……！", "zh": "这也是……为了反差萌……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "75dd2536c10902b3a41a3a78d40effe7c4ca55e013a45566d5a4b41fe1c0a422", "ja": "……わかったわ、{$P$}。\nそういう事なら、まかせてちょうだい！", "zh": "……我明白了，{$P$}。\n既然是这样的话，就尽管交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0273_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "8bd6b3abfb914f59664f0e731d29dfa6981416ddb25827f18fe7a321eeae228c", "ja": "ダークでシリアスな私と、アダルティでセクシーな私。\n相反する魅力で、みんなを虜にしてみせるわ……！", "zh": "阴暗严肃的我，以及成熟性感的我。\n我要用这两种截然相反的魅力，把大家迷得神魂颠倒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
